<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:background="@color/card_white">

    <LinearLayout
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:orientation="vertical"
        android:padding="22dp">

        <!-- Drag Handle -->
        <View
            android:layout_width="42dp"
            android:layout_height="4dp"
            android:layout_gravity="center_horizontal"
            android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"
            android:background="#CBD5E1" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:text="📖 App User Guide — By Maan"
            android:textColor="@color/text_primary"
            android:textSize="20sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:text="Har feature aur button ko istemal karne ka mukammal tareeqa:"
            android:textColor="@color/text_secondary"
            android:textSize="13sp" />

        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="16dp"
            android:text="1. Mode Selector (Polynomial vs Standard f(x))"
            android:textColor="@color/brand_royal"
            android:textSize="15sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp"
            android:text="• Polynomial: Algebraic equations (jaise 2 + 3x + x²) ko integrate karne ke liye.
• Standard f(x): Trigonometry aur special functions (sin(x), cos(x), sec²(x), eˣ, 1/x, 1/√x) ke liye."
            android:textColor="@color/text_primary"
            android:textSize="13.5sp" />

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="14dp"
            android:text="2. Polynomial Coefficients Kaise Likhein?"
            android:textColor="@color/brand_royal"
            android:textSize="15sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp"
            android:text="• Coefficients ko x⁰ (constant) se xⁿ ki tartib mein comma (,) ya space se likhein.
• Misal: '2, 3, 1' ka matlab hai 2 + 3x + 1x².
• Agar koi power missing ho to us ki jagah 0 likhein (e.g. '1, 0, 0, 4' = 1 + 4x³)."
            android:textColor="@color/text_primary"
            android:textSize="13.5sp" />

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="14dp"
            android:text="3. Quick Sample Chips"
            android:textColor="@color/brand_royal"
            android:textSize="15sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp"
            android:text="• Input box ke neeche neelay chips par tap karne se tayyar misalein aur limits khud fill ho jati hain taake aap foran test kar sakein."
            android:textColor="@color/text_primary"
            android:textSize="13.5sp" />

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="14dp"
            android:text="4. Definite Limits [a, b] (Optional)"
            android:textColor="@color/brand_royal"
            android:textSize="15sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp"
            android:text="• Sirf Indefinite Integral (+ C) chahiye to Lower (a) aur Upper (b) boxes khali chhor dein.
• Definite value ∫ₐᵇ f(x)dx nikalne ke liye a aur b dono numbers likhein (sin/cos/sec² ke liye angles radians mein dein)."
            android:textColor="@color/text_primary"
            android:textSize="13.5sp" />

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="14dp"
            android:text="5. Buttons Ka Istemal"
            android:textColor="@color/brand_royal"
            android:textSize="15sp"
            android:textStyle="bold" />

        <TextView
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:lineSpacingExtra="3dp"
            android:text="• ∫ Calculate: Function aur us ka exact integral solve karta hai.
• Clear: Saare input boxes aur purana result reset karta hai.
• Copy: Result card ke upar Copy button dabane se poora solution clipboard par copy ho jata hai."
            android:textColor="@color/text_primary"
            android:textSize="13.5sp" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/btnCloseHelp"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="48dp"
            android:layout_marginTop="20dp"
            android:text="Samajh Aa Gaya (Close)"
            android:textAllCaps="false"
            android:textSize="15sp"
            android:textStyle="bold"
            app:backgroundTint="@color/brand_royal"
            app:cornerRadius="14dp" />
    </LinearLayout>
</androidx.core.widget.NestedScrollView>
